{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Hey Jolene! Great news - I just started a project for a cleanup in our community and have been trying to raise funds for it. It's been amazing to see everyone come together to make a difference. How've you been? Anything new going on?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-86144a143a40bd4a55051df6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:28.946684+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "86144a143a40bd4a55051df6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "86144a143a40bd4a55051df6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Hey Debs! Congrats on your project for the community! As for me, life's been a rollercoaster lately. Last week, I had a huge setback with my project. I put in so much work and it all crashed and I lost everything. SO frustrating and depressing."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-200da304a8038ec94ec6b800", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:28.969992+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "200da304a8038ec94ec6b800", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "200da304a8038ec94ec6b800", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Jolene, sorry to hear that. It must be really tough. I'm here for you and if I can do anything, just let me know. Is there anything that's helping you cope?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-8cfd42ee56257d47b5dabb3f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:28.987355+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8cfd42ee56257d47b5dabb3f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8cfd42ee56257d47b5dabb3f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Your support means a lot. Susie really helps when times get tough. Pets have been great company. Video games have also been a nice distraction."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-6772f9e9f523610fe732d409", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.001375+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6772f9e9f523610fe732d409", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6772f9e9f523610fe732d409", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: They can really provide love and comfort, especially during tough times. How did you come to have Susie?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-c1df2c2cdfff113a7388055d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.015968+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c1df2c2cdfff113a7388055d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c1df2c2cdfff113a7388055d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I adopted her two years ago when I was feeling lonely and wanted some company."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-0b24245c4bfd4f318af32816", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.032556+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0b24245c4bfd4f318af32816", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0b24245c4bfd4f318af32816", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: That's great, Jolene! Animals sure have a way of bringing us happiness. They understand us and provide us with comfort. Plus, having a pet teaches us responsibility. She came at the perfect time - cherish those moments with her and find strength in her presence."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-4c4ed1f1571e6de2a99a5054", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.048234+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4c4ed1f1571e6de2a99a5054", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4c4ed1f1571e6de2a99a5054", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Thanks Deborah. Having her around shows me I can stay strong and find joy in the small stuff."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-e918258fbcbbdfe9c2b9e81a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.062302+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e918258fbcbbdfe9c2b9e81a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e918258fbcbbdfe9c2b9e81a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Enjoying the little things is key. Those little moments can give us a boost and push us forward. How have you been taking care of yourself lately?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-73684f25c58d589839fce59b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.079660+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "73684f25c58d589839fce59b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "73684f25c58d589839fce59b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I'm trying to prioritize self-care, like yoga and meditation. It helps me stay balanced and grounded."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-1d4cafec78722423fe5c2b03", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.095661+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1d4cafec78722423fe5c2b03", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1d4cafec78722423fe5c2b03", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: If you're interested, I can suggest some routines for you to try."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-45c98182f61c3d9c77a75058", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.105905+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "45c98182f61c3d9c77a75058", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "45c98182f61c3d9c77a75058", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: I'm always on the lookout for new routines to mix things up."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-08df7000d0785f1db2652dac", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.117254+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "08df7000d0785f1db2652dac", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "08df7000d0785f1db2652dac", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: In the meantime, check out this great place for yoga."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-1b6e8c63c278e49085b0122c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.130766+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1b6e8c63c278e49085b0122c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1b6e8c63c278e49085b0122c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: This room looks perfect for it. Do you have any favorite routines you can share?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-11785004a52202fc3b2fe047", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.144654+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "11785004a52202fc3b2fe047", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "11785004a52202fc3b2fe047", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: One of my favorite yoga routines is a gentle flow that's all about breathing and grounding. It helps me find my chill. I'll send you a tutorial video with the poses. This is me in the process :)"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-67c234f71139ef1bd017bc66", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.156408+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "67c234f71139ef1bd017bc66", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "67c234f71139ef1bd017bc66", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Wow! Does that help you find your chill or improve your concentration?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-d95ec2ac2e5d8aaff53bb005", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.169677+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d95ec2ac2e5d8aaff53bb005", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d95ec2ac2e5d8aaff53bb005", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: It's a great way to find balance in tough times. Try it out and let me know what you think!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-c4d57a768cfec95d64fe1a9c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.181736+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c4d57a768cfec95d64fe1a9c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c4d57a768cfec95d64fe1a9c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Can't wait to try it out. Let's chat soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-b5493ce9d01b5b1049f09b60", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.194759+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b5493ce9d01b5b1049f09b60", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b5493ce9d01b5b1049f09b60", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Deborah: Let me know how it goes. Talk to you later!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-4efef5b4bdaba99471015855", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.205582+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4efef5b4bdaba99471015855", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4efef5b4bdaba99471015855", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jolene: Yep, I'll practice and update you. Bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-48/session_16-5d36903c7ffc081fce63ad51", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:56:29.222291+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5d36903c7ffc081fce63ad51", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5d36903c7ffc081fce63ad51", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
